msgid ""
"The JST-GH-6P connector supports a standard DJI HD VTX connection. Pin 1 of "
"the connector is 9v so be careful not to connect this to a peripheral "
"requiring 5v. The 9v supply is controlled by RELAY_PIN2 set to GPIO 81 and "
"is on by default. It can be configured to be operated by an RC switch by "
"selecting the function RELAY2."
